<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hollinger started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hollinger started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns said on Friday it had started coverage of Hollinger International Inc with a buy recommendation.</p>
<p>-- Details of the recommendation were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock rose 3/8 to 11-3/4 in midmorning exchange trade.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
